{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.poster.avif?t=1758326456\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.webm?t=1758326456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.mp4?t=1758326456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Second Stellar is a horde roguelike that focuses on engaging gameplay and buildcrafting. Fight through swaths of enemies and powerful bosses as two characters simultaneously, wielding unique weaponry and discovering potent combinations in pursuit of the galaxy's many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/3c64f839c229bfd9b345d222b72b21d2.webp?t=1758326456\" width=596 height=13 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this demo, preview the upcoming adventure through exploring the first stage: Forgotten Outskirts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a glimpse of the full game through defeating waves of foes, growing stronger, and acquiring potent item and weapon combinations. After your voyage, upgrade the Observatory to unlock  more items for your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a challenge, try to master the demo through completing all of the demo-unique achievements, with more demo content in production!\u00a0Please defer to the full game page to get the full picture of what Second Stellar has to offer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032450?t=1758326456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/d9fadd812c8ebec5281fbc666479757d272f75bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758326456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/a8e6d0c77e06950a650716274b3fa66b7caf3840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758326456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/a8e6d0c77e06950a650716274b3fa66b7caf3840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758326456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.poster.avif?t=1758326456\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.webm?t=1758326456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/1d012083158b5464234fe4d3130fa2c1.mp4?t=1758326456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Second Stellar is a horde roguelike that focuses on engaging gameplay and buildcrafting. Fight through swaths of enemies and powerful bosses as two characters simultaneously, wielding unique weaponry and discovering potent combinations in pursuit of the galaxy's many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/extras/3c64f839c229bfd9b345d222b72b21d2.webp?t=1758326456\" width=596 height=13 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this demo, preview the upcoming adventure through exploring the first stage: Forgotten Outskirts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a glimpse of the full game through defeating waves of foes, growing stronger, and acquiring potent item and weapon combinations. After your voyage, upgrade the Observatory to unlock  more items for your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a challenge, try to master the demo through completing all of the demo-unique achievements, with more demo content in production!\u00a0Please defer to the full game page to get the full picture of what Second Stellar has to offer.</p>","developers":["Pepperlog"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3176850","name":"Second Stellar"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032450/96109483a696c72f138b8ba5c109a32fbdf58a42/header.jpg?t=1758326456","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257197556,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197556/movie480.mp4?t=1758052348","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197556/movie_max.mp4?t=1758052348"},"name":"SecondStellarDemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197556/317ac15278491d29aa18986e78eebb05e75828fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758052348","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197556/movie480_vp